### --- Rgister webhook in Telegram API

GET https://api.telegram.org/bot{{$dotenv BOT_TOKEN}}/setWebhook?secret_token={{$dotenv BOT_CALLBACK_TOKEN}}&url=https%3A%2F%2Fe4dduo4cf2.execute-api.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com%2Fcallback

### --- Rgister webhook (Tribalizm proxy) in Telegram API

GET https://api.telegram.org/bot{{$dotenv BOT_TOKEN}}/setWebhook?secret_token={{$dotenv BOT_CALLBACK_TOKEN}}&url=https%3A%2F%2Ftribalizm.rblab.net%2Fcallback

